> explain (verbose, costs off) select w, i from a40_wt w join a40_int4 i on w.a = i.f1
QUERY PLAN:text
Merge Join
  Output: w.*, i.*
  Merge Cond: (i.f1 = w.a)
  ->  Sort
        Output: i.*, i.f1
        Sort Key: i.f1
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a40_int4 i
              Output: i.*, i.f1
  ->  Sort
        Output: w.*, w.a
        Sort Key: w.a
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a40_wt w
              Output: w.*, w.a
-- EXPLAIN

> set enable_mergejoin = off
-- SET

