QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop
  Output: w.*, i.*
  Join Filter: (w.a = i.f1)
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a40_wt w
        Output: w.*, w.a
  ->  Materialize
        Output: i.*, i.f1
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a40_int4 i
              Output: i.*, i.f1
